                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02d3803b-9fa9-4d29-b7d1-758f22253788",
                                                "sense_id": "de594eb0-82a0-3661-8b83-d7966673ee47",
                                                "text": "So la-da-di-da-di, we like to party / Dancing with Molly / Doing whatever we want"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0519e676-937b-45c8-ac4f-58e197874a6d",
                                                "sense_id": "de594eb0-82a0-3661-8b83-d7966673ee47",
                                                "text": "Was pissed now. But also hyper-lit, euphoric almost, given the adrenaline plus molly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45d616a4-bbf3-3354-a6b4-be3a17d053ee",
                                        "entry_id": "f9e3e97e-9a44-3e41-b6a4-86d1129a843d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mollemoke."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68714e1d-0568-4b23-ac7d-62eca14e0024",
                                                "sense_id": "45d616a4-bbf3-3354-a6b4-be3a17d053ee",
                                                "text": "So the petrels called to the mollys: but they were so busy and greedy, gobbling and pecking and spluttering and fighting over the blubber, that they did not take the least notice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
